  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Partnership Framework with the United Nations Relief and Works Agency (UNRWA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The United Nations Relief and Works Agency for Palestinian Refugees in the Near East (UNRWA) is mandated to provide assistance and protection to over 5 million Palestinian refugees. It delivers key essential services in education, health care, relief and social services, microfinance, infrastructure and refugee camp improvement, emergency assistance and protection of refugees&apos; rights in its five field areas of Gaza, West Bank, Jordan, Lebanon and Syria. Funding under this investment represents Australia&apos;s core contributions to the UNRWA Strategic Partnership Framework.</narrative>
  </description>
